# Environment files are application-specific; do not share model/search keys with Web.
# Web: copy apps/web/.env.example to apps/web/.env.local
# Backend: copy apps/backend/.env.example to apps/backend/.env
# Load the backend file explicitly: uvicorn app.main:app --env-file .env
# See docs/chat/README.md and docs/auth/CONFIGURATION.md.
# Multi-provider LLM configuration: docs/engineering/llm-api-foundation.md (Backend only).
